      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>Revisions</code></a> instance for the given <a href=\"Revision.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>Revision</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"Revision.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的类\"><code>Revision</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的类\"><code>Revisions</code></a>实例。",
