    {
      "source": "Simple wrapper class for a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of <a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>Revisions</code></a> allowing to canonically access the latest revision.\nAllows iterating over the underlying <a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>Revisions</code></a> starting with older revisions.",
      "translation": "一个用于封装 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>List</code></a> 的简单包装类，该列表包含 <a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的类\"><code>Revisions</code></a> 对象，允许以规范方式访问最新修订版本。  \n支持从较旧的修订版本开始遍历底层的 <a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的类\"><code>Revisions</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Reverses the current <a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>Revisions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "反转当前的<a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的类\"><code>Revisions</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Reverses the current <a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>Revisions</code></a>. By default this will return the revisions with the latest revision first.",
      "translation": "反转当前的<a href=\"Revisions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的类\"><code>Revisions</code></a>。默认情况下，这将返回以最新修订版为首的修订版本。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "will never be null.",
      "translation": "永远不会为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>will never be null.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>永远不会为 null。</dd>",
      "count": 1
